data: {"id": "2d51fe6facbf4c4e-thinking-parallel_evidence-238", "run_id": "2d51fe6facbf4c4e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好，pre-react 基线已经提供了关键线索：\n\n- **Metrics**: `kube_pod_status_phase`=Running=1，但 `last_terminated_reason=OOMKilled`(1)，`prometheus容器restarts=2` → 确认有 OOM 历史\n- **Logging**: 30 分钟内存在大量 `\"Evaluating rule failed ... found duplicate series for the match group ... many-to-many matching not allowed\"` 错误\n- **Tracing**: DeepFlow 有 20 条 HTTP 入站流指向该 Pod（`/federate`），无有效 Tempo trace_id，请求时长极大（~45秒），全部 200 但响应极慢\n\n现在我需要执行 kubectl 工具来补充 Kubernetes 生命周期、事件和当前日志。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788793671016, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

