data: {"id": "2d51fe6facbf4c4e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1143", "run_id": "2d51fe6facbf4c4e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "read_context_archive", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "read_context_archive 输出摘要: raw_chars=1021 lines=9\n<context_archive>\narchive_path: /tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/2d51fe6facbf4c4e-g2/tools/011-evidence-kubectl_logs.raw.txt\noffset: 0\nreturned_cha", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788794018310, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g2", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_0b0ae019f9df4fb3ad8aba2f", "tool_sequence": 13, "semantic_success": true, "result": "read_context_archive 输出摘要: raw_chars=1021 lines=9\n<context_archive>\narchive_path: /tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/2d51fe6facbf4c4e-g2/tools/011-evidence-kubectl_logs.raw.txt\noffset: 0\nreturned_chars: 818\ntotal_chars: 818\ncontent:\nPrometheus rule manager日志显示大量规则评估失败，原因为目标实例 `10.2.0.48:10250` 存在重复series（duplicate series），违反many-to-many匹配约束。\nkey_facts: [\"component: rule manager, level: WARN\", \"失败规则: CPUThrottlingHigh, node_quantile:kubelet_pleg_relist_duration_seconds:histogram_quantile (0.99, 0.9, 0.5), KubeletPodStartUpLatencyHigh\", \"错误类型: found duplicate series for the match group {instance=\\\"10.2.0.48:10250\\\", ...}\", \"重复来源 (instance): kubelet_node_name (service: observability-kubelet vs obsstable-observability-kubelet)\", \"重复来源 (pod): gpu-operator-849b44c54c-52sbm (service: obsstable-observability-kubelet vs obs-sizecheck-observabilit-kubelet)\", \"namespace冲突: admin (gpu-operator), kube-system (master node)\", \"错误原因: many-to-many matching not allowed: matching labels must be unique on one side\", \"时间范围: 2026-09-07T14:58:14 至 14:58:57\"]\n</context_archive>", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/2d51fe6facbf4c4e-g2/tools/016-evidence-read_context_archive.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/2d51fe6facbf4c4e-g2/tools/016-evidence-read_context_archive.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/2d51fe6facbf4c4e-g2/tools/016-evidence-read_context_archive.summary.txt"}

