data: {"id": "2d51fe6facbf4c4e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1657", "run_id": "2d51fe6facbf4c4e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "让我基于真实工具结果进行因果分析。首先确认实体身份和生命周期状态。\n\n**实体确认：**\n- Pod: `monitor/prometheus-observability-prometheus-0`\n- UID: `765655de-3481-4d60-b455-1fa4b463a0c2` (来自拓扑查询)\n- 节点: `node1` (IP: 172.16.166.165)\n- 控制器: StatefulSet `prometheus-observability-prometheus`\n- Service: `observability-prometheus`\n\n**当前状态事实：**\n1. Pod 状态为 Running（Started: 2026-09-03T01:14:21）\n2. 上次状态为 Terminated，Reason: OOMKilled (Exit Code 137, Finished: 2026-09-03T01:14:19)\n3. 重启次数: 2\n4. 资源限制: cpu=100m, memory=512Mi\n\n**冲突分析：**\n1. **Running v", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788794033382, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

